From 3a1cfd55e3ac7746a97969d71c2361f4a4b14333 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MiaAI Lab <mia.ailab1@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 19:14:59 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] server: TF_TOOL_CALL_GUARD=1, an opt-in guard against
 tool-call markup reaching the client as text: a chat request that offers no
 tools (none sent, or tool_choice "none") although its history called them
 gets a closing system note that tools are unavailable and its call markup
 hidden; a request that offers tools has the envelopes the parser keeps as
 text (unoffered tools, malformed calls) hidden; streamed or whole, each
 logged

---
